        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Sign in to Dreamina in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → Dreamina → Dreamina Settings**.\n2. Describe your host in **Host**, and what they do in **Scene**.\n3. Press **Run**. The video is saved under `video/dreamina`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
