          "widget": {
            "name": "text"
          }
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedance 2.0 Mini, the video node's starting model, starts on the host and makes a four-second `720p` video. With one picture connected, the node uses `first_last_frame`, the mode that starts the video on that picture. A second picture would set the last frame. Raise `duration` in `arguments` for up to 15 seconds.\n\nA cancel does not stop a video Dreamina has accepted. It keeps running and is billed. Collect it with **Generation: Download** in **video-04-recover-a-video**."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
    },
